{
  "description": "The sign-in routes' sliding window, 20 requests per 60 s per address. Each step sends `times` requests from `identity` at `atMs` after the scenario's start, each one answered `allowed`; `remaining` and `resetAtMs` (after the start) are the last answer's.",
